                                "sense_id": "0b4bf3ef-fbae-3f78-ac88-3f4b5d7813cf",
                                "text": "It must be granted, poor George Wilhelm's case demanded circumspectness."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a8dca7e-f93a-433a-bde5-d37e1dd2a942",
                                "sense_id": "0b4bf3ef-fbae-3f78-ac88-3f4b5d7813cf",
                                "text": "\"But if to the audacity of the design there be brought a commensurate circumspectness of execution, how then?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c44598e8-9a51-4fb9-b159-5875220fe60b",
                                "sense_id": "0b4bf3ef-fbae-3f78-ac88-3f4b5d7813cf",
                                "text": "If our suspicion be wholly unfounded, let his own questionable ways, not our necessary circumspectness bear the blame."
